# Build-context excludes for services/bd-render/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads
# <dockerfile>.dockerignore). The build only COPYs build123d/{pyproject.toml,
# uv.lock,holders,scripts} and services/bd-render/ — everything else is dead
# weight in the context.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
.git
app
components
hooks
lib
models
libs
scripts
services/render
exports
renders
test-results
tests
build123d/.venv
build123d/out
build123d/baked
build123d/viewer
build123d/docs
build123d/tests
*.stl
*.glb
